 "transcript": [
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and I suppose he will die like all the rest and be buried in the family plot and his sons will not care for his grave and will not visit it, but I will make a coffin for my father and I will be buried in the family plot and my sons will come and visit my grave,\"",
  "[says] Wang Lung asks his son why he is so angry.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) Wang Lung's sons argue over inheritance.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The eldest son mocks his brother's ambitions.",
  "[action] The eldest son mocks his brother.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son mocks his brother's ambitions.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now you have been a fool to say that, for I do not know what your heart is and I will not have a fool in my house!\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son mocks his brother's ambitions.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son defends himself.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"I will have this money in the grain market and I will build a house for my wife and my son and my grandchildren and there is to be a big house of stone walls and I will have two inner rooms and a big hall for my guests,\"",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"My brother is speaking against me and I will tell him of his debts and how he has spent money which I have kept in the shop and I will say that he has squandered all that is left of our father's money.\"",
  "[action] Second brother acts on his threats.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second brother slaps his brother.",
  "[action] The eldest son retaliates against his brother.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son slaps his father.",
  "[silence] the eldest son says nothing.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son slaps the father again.",
  "[action] Wang Lung cries out, falling to the ground.",
